"ln\">55</td><td class=\"src\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#34;error&#34;: 3,</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ln\">56</td><td class=\"src\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#34;fail&#34;: 3,</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ln\">57</td><td class=\"src\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#34;timeout&#34;: 2,</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ln\">58</td><td class=\"src\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#34;warn&#34;: 2,</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ln\">59</td><td class=\"src\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#34;slow&#34;: 2,</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ln\">60</td><td class=\"src\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#34;retry&#34;: 1,</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ln\">61</td><td class=\"src\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#34;info&#34;: 0,</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ln\">62</td><td class=\"src\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#34;ok&#34;: 0,</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ln\">63</td><td class=\"src\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}</td></tr>\n  </table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"evidence\">\n  <p class=\"evidence-head\">#22 <span class=\"badge prov prov-static\">STATIC</span> Heavy work at import time \u00b7 <span class=\"mono\">shopfast/reporting.py:8</span></p>\n  <table class=\"code\">\n<tr><td class=\"ln\">8</td><td class=\"src\">from pathlib import Path</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ln\">9</td><td class=\"src\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ln\">10</td><td class=\"src\">with open(Path(__file__).with_name(&#34;report_header.txt&#34;), encoding=&#34;utf-8&#34;) as _header_file:</td></tr>\n  </table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"evidence\">\n  <p class=\"evidence-head\">#23 <span class=\"badge prov prov-static\">STATIC</span> Same expensive call repeated with identical constant arguments \u00b7 <span class=\"mono\">shopfast/pricing.py:68</span></p>\n  <table class=\"code\">\n<tr><td class=\"ln\">68</td><td class=\"src\">def currency_table() -&gt; dict[str, float]:</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ln\">69</td><td class=\"src\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;rates = json.loads(RATES_JSON)[&#34;rates&#34;]</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ln\">70</td><td class=\"src\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;symbols = json.loads(RATES_JSON)[&#34;symbols&#34;]</td></tr>\n  </table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"evidence\">\n  <p class=\"evidence-head\">#24 <span class=\"badge prov prov-static\">STATIC</span> Constant regex pattern processed inside a loop \u00b7 <span class=\"mono\">shopfast/reporting.py:31</span></p>\n  <table class=\"code\">\n<tr><td class=\"ln\">31</td><td class=\"src\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;skus = []</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ln\">32</td><td class=\"src\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;for line in lines:</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ln\">33</td><td class=\"src\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;match = re.search(r&#34;SKU-(\\d{6})&#34;, line)</td></tr>\n  </table>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section>\n<h2 id=\"s7\"><span class=\"secnum\">7</span> CPU &amp; memory measurements</h2>\n<div class=\"callout not-measured\">\n  <p class=\"callout-title\">Not measured \u2014 static audit only.</p>\n  <p>No repository code was executed for this audit, so there are no CPU or memory measurements. Runtime profiling requires an explicitly approved Runtime Audit in the isolated sandbox.</p>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n<section>\n<h2 id=\"s8\"><span class=\"secnum\">8</span> Algorithmic complexity analysis</h2>\n<p class=\"muted\">Complexity figures are estimates derived from code structure (loop nesting, collection operations). They are not measurements and assume the input sizes implied by the code.</p>\n<table class=\"data\">\n  <thead><tr><th width=\"5%\">#</th><th width=\"47%\">Finding</th><th width=\"33%\">Estimate</th><th width=\"15%\">Provenance</th><